    "description": "Gov. Gavin Newsom has launched a panel to craft regulations for California’s AI firms, including the possibility of a kill switch, amid rising concerns over the technology’s risks. The move marks a shift from his earlier veto of similar legislation and highlights uncertainty about how such safeguards could work.",
    "category": "AI",
    "date": "2026-09-19",
    "publishedAt": "2026-09-19T02:30:26.449Z",
    "author": "Tejendra Pal Singh",
